              MMAAPP__SSHHAARREEDD mappings ignore unknown flags in _f_l_a_g_s.  By contrast,
              when  creating  a  mapping using MMAAPP__SSHHAARREEDD__VVAALLIIDDAATTEE, the kernel
              verifies all passed flags are known and fails the  mapping  with
